  "headline": "NasDem, Golkar, And PAN Formally Support Sugiono For Vice President",
  "seoTitle": "Sugiono Nominated As Vice President By Political Parties",
  "metaDescription": "Multiple political parties in Indonesia, including NasDem, Golkar, and PAN, have expressed support for Sugiono as the next Vice President.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "NasDem, Golkar, and PAN have formally declared their support for Sugiono to serve as Vice President for the 2024-2029 term.",
    "The coalition seeks to elect a successor to the vice presidency through an open vote during an upcoming People's Consultative Assembly session.",
    "Supporters describe the candidate as an ideological partner to President Prabowo Subianto capable of immediately assuming official duties."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political landscape in Indonesia is currently focused on the selection of a new Vice President to serve out the remainder of the 2024-2029 term. Following initiatives by the Gerindra party, several major political organizations have solidified their backing for Sugiono. NasDem has pledged total support following directives from its leadership, while Golkar confirmed alignment with the President's vision, offering to back the candidate as part of their coalition commitment. The National Mandate Party (PAN) has also joined the effort, characterizing the candidate as a close ideological ally to the President. While these parties push for an open voting process at the upcoming People's Consultative Assembly session scheduled for December 11, other organizations like the Democratic Party have indicated they have yet to determine an official stance regarding the nomination process.",
